        "subject": "LU-20337 tests: fix obdfilter-survey to parse IPv6",
        "message": "LU-20337 tests: fix obdfilter-survey to parse IPv6\n\nobdfilter-survey uses a `:` delimiter to parse `host:device`. When\nthe host is an IPv6 address, which contains multiple embedded `:`,\nthe parsing fails. The fix is to split the string on the last `:`.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=obdfilter-survey\nSigned-off-by: Xinxia Qu <xqu@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I4c8da5669dc4ba99040eda10d6d4d29966c53de6\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
